        "title": "Creator Contracts, Licensing & Invoicing (Part 2)",
        "content": "| Tax & Accounting Parameter | Category A: Advertising & Promotional Service | Category B: IP / Copyright Licensing Fee |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Invoice Line Item Description** | \"Social Media Promotion & Content Creation Services for Campaign X\" | \"Licensing Rights Fee for Commercial Video Asset Usage (90 Days)\" |\n| **GST SAC Code (Services Accounting Code)** | **998361** (Advertising Services) | **997332** (Licensing Services of Intellectual Property) |\n| **Income Tax TDS Section** | Section 194C (1% for Ind/HUF) or Section 194J (10%) | Section 194J (10% Royalty / IP Rights Fee) |\n| **Applicable GST Rate** | 18% | 18% |\n| **Practical Guidance** | Use for standard integrations, Reels, & sponsored posts | Use when selling raw video footage rights to brands for TV/Ads |\n\n---\n\n### Professional Creator Tax Invoice Template\n\nSending a haphazard text message with your UPI ID makes you look like an amateur. Brands' accounts departments prioritize formal PDF Tax Invoices. Below is a compliant invoice layout:\n\n```markdown\n================================================================================\n                         INVOICE / TAX INVOICE\n================================================================================\nINVOICE NO: RM/2025-26/089                     INVOICE DATE: 15 November 2025\nDUE DATE: 15 December 2025 (Net 30)            SAC CODE: 998361\n\nISSUED BY (CREATOR):                           BILLED TO (CLIENT / BRAND):\nRohan Digital Studios                          Nexus Marketing Pvt Ltd\nPAN: ABCPR9876K                                GSTIN: 27AAAAA1234A1Z5\nGSTIN: 07ABCDE5678F1ZH (If GST Regd)           Attn: Accounts Payable Team\nAddress: Flat 402, Green Park, New Delhi       Address: Bandra-Kurla Complex, Mumbai\nEmail: business@rohandigital.in                Email: finance@nexusmarketing.in\nPhone: +91 98765 43210\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nS.No.  Description of Deliverables         Qty   Rate (₹)    Total Amount (₹)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1.     YouTube Integrated Video (90 sec)  1     60,000.00     60,000.00\n       Video Title: \"Top Tech Gear 2025\"\n2.     Instagram Reel (Dedicated 60 sec)   1     30,000.00     30,000.00\n3.     Limited Digital Usage Rights       90    Included          0.00\n       (90 Days Social Media License)     Days\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                                          SUBTOTAL:          ₹90,000.00\n                                          CGST @ 9%:         ₹ 8,100.00 (If Regd)\n                                          SGST @ 9%:         ₹ 8,100.00 (If Regd)\n                                          TOTAL AMOUNT DUE: ₹1,06,200.00\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBANK PAYMENT DETAILS:\nBank Name: HDFC Bank Ltd | Account Name: Rohan Digital Studios\nAccount No: 50100987654321 | IFSC Code: HDFC0000123\nBranch: Green Park, New Delhi | UPI ID: rohandigital@hdfcbank\n\nCOMPLIANCE & REMARKS:\n1. Payment due strictly within 30 days. Delayed payments accrue 18% p.a. interest.\n2. Applicable TDS under Section 194J (10%) or 194C (1%) to be deposited against \n   PAN: ABCPR9876K. Form 16A TDS certificate to be shared quarterly.\n================================================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n### Agency Follow-Up Protocol & MSMED Act Legal Protections\n\nIf an agency goes silent when your payment is 60 days overdue, follow this structured **4-Step Escalation Protocol**:\n\n```\n[Day T-5]    ──────► Automated Friendly Payment Reminder with Invoice Copy Attached\n     │\n[Day T+7]    ──────► Formal Escalation Email to Finance Head + Pause Active Deliverables\n     │\n[Day T+30]   ──────► Legal Notice Citing MSMED Act 45-Day Statutory Mandate\n     │\n[Day T+45]   ──────► Direct Online Case Filing on Govt MSME Samadhaan Portal\n```\n\n#### Copy-Paste Email Templates for Overdue Payment Recovery:\n\n##### Email 1: Friendly Due Date Reminder (Day T-5)\n```text\nSubject: Upcoming Invoice Due Date Reminder: Invoice #RM/2025-26/089 [Nexus Marketing]\n\nHi [Brand Manager Name],\n\nHope you are doing well! \n\nQuick reminder that Invoice #RM/2025-26/089 for ₹90,000 (Campaign: Top Tech Gear 2025) is due for payment on 15 December 2025. \n\nAttached is a copy of the invoice for your convenience. Please confirm if everything is in order for processing.\n\nBank Details:\nHDFC Bank | A/C: 50100987654321 | IFSC: HDFC0000123",
